    <Definition xsi:type="MyObjectBuilder_UpgradeModuleDefinition">
      <Id>
        <TypeId>UpgradeModule</TypeId>
        <SubtypeId>ArcanePower_Thermal_SpaceRadiator</SubtypeId>
      </Id>
      <DisplayName>Arcane Radiator rotor base</DisplayName>
      <Icon>Textures/GUI/Icons/ArcanePower/Thermal/ArcanePower_Thermal_SpaceRadiator.dds</Icon>
      <Description>Airtight radiator rotor base.

INSTALLATION
Airtight 1x1x1 hull mount with a bottom duplex socket.
Automatic edge-on sun tracking. The base provides no cooling.

PANELS
Stack up to three separate panels on the top shaft coupling.
Match Up; any yaw works. Mixed tiers add their own cooling.
Keep both panel faces exposed to space.
Grind either panel face to remove a section.

ENVIRONMENT
Shade or edge-on: 100% cooling. Full sun: 50%.
Angle, shade and weather follow solar-panel exposure.</Description>
      <CubeSize>Large</CubeSize>
      <BlockTopology>TriangleMesh</BlockTopology>
      <Size x="1" y="1" z="1" />
      <ModelOffset x="0" y="0" z="0" />
