      </Id>
      <DisplayName>Arcane Straight Pipe (Manifold)</DisplayName>
      <Icon>Textures/GUI/Icons/ArcanePower/Thermal/ArcanePower_Thermal_PrimaryStraight.dds</Icon>
      <Description>CO2 supply/return pipe for one independent reactor manifold circuit.
Use an Arcane pipe rotor to cross to a subgrid.
Fully enclosed, airtight on all six faces.

Align H to H and C to C.
Cap unused pipe mouths; a breach closes this circuit at the reactor.
Ordinary conveyors do not replace thermal pipes.</Description>
