    <Definition xsi:type="MyObjectBuilder_ReactorDefinition">
      <Id>
        <TypeId>Reactor</TypeId>
        <SubtypeId>ArcanePower_Thermal_ReactorHousing</SubtypeId>
      </Id>
      <DisplayName>Arcane Reactor</DisplayName>
      <Icon>Textures/GUI/Icons/ArcanePower/Thermal/ArcanePower_Thermal_ReactorHousing.dds</Icon>
      <Description>FUELS AND OUTPUT
Aether: 5 GW fuel input. Helion: 50 GW. Empyrean: 250 GW.
Standalone: Aether only, 10% conversion / 500 MW electrical.
Brayton: flat 80% fuel conversion; 1 GW output needs 1 GW cooling.
Helion and Empyrean require Brayton to prevent meltdown.

ASSEMBLY
Two working controllers and a complete vent route are required.
At least one fully built, functional advanced controller unlocks Brayton.
The reactor generates CO2 internally.

CIRCUITS
Four independent manifolds; one turbine plus cooling per circuit.
Each circuit supplies up to 25% capacity.
Align H/C, keep circuits separate and cap unused pipe mouths.

SHUTDOWN AND SAFETY
A circuit breach isolates that manifold.
Losing all valid circuits stops generation.
Runtime faults stop generation while intact cooling paths stay open.
A manual Start with all four circuits defective latches a startup fault.
Normal Stop does not latch. Stop and cool before changing mode.</Description>
      <CubeSize>Large</CubeSize>
      <BlockTopology>TriangleMesh</BlockTopology>
      <Size x="5" y="3" z="5" />
      <ModelOffset x="0" y="0" z="0" />
      <Model>Models/Cubes/large/Thermal/thermal_7ebca2a08762/APT_ReactorHousing_M.mwm</Model>
      <Components>
        <Component Subtype="SteelPlate" Count="2400" />
        <Component Subtype="Construction" Count="1000" />
        <Component Subtype="MetalGrid" Count="600" />
        <Component Subtype="LargeTube" Count="240" />
        <Component Subtype="Reactor" Count="2000" />
        <Component Subtype="Motor" Count="200" />
        <Component Subtype="Superconductor" Count="1500" />
        <Component Subtype="BulletproofGlass" Count="160" />
        <Component Subtype="Computer" Count="400" />
        <Component Subtype="SteelPlate" Count="600" />
      </Components>
      <CriticalComponent Subtype="Computer" Index="0" />
      <BlockPairName>ArcanePower_Thermal_ReactorHousing</BlockPairName>
      <EdgeType>Light</EdgeType>
      <BuildTimeSeconds>40</BuildTimeSeconds>
      <ResourceSourceGroup>Reactors</ResourceSourceGroup>
      <MaxPowerOutput>1000</MaxPowerOutput>
      <InventorySize>
        <X>2</X>
        <Y>1</Y>
        <Z>1</Z>
      </InventorySize>
      <InventoryFillFactorMin>0.0005</InventoryFillFactorMin>
      <InventoryFillFactorMax>0.001</InventoryFillFactorMax>
      <FuelPullAmountFromConveyorInMinutes>10.0</FuelPullAmountFromConveyorInMinutes>
      <FuelInfos />
      <PrimarySound />
