      <Icon>Textures/GUI/Icons/ArcanePower/Thermal/ArcanePower_Thermal_RadiatorPanel.dds</Icon>
      <Description>2 GW ideal heat rejection per unit/panel.

INSTALLATION
Stack directly above a rotor base or the preceding panel.
Aim at the top shaft coupling on the same grid.
Match the base Up axis; any yaw works. Panels align automatically.
Maximum three panels per base; unattached panels provide no cooling.
Grind either panel face to remove a section.

ENVIRONMENT
Shade or edge-on: 100% cooling. Full sun: 50%.</Description>
