      <DisplayName>Arcane Pipe rotor head</DisplayName>
      <Icon>Textures/GUI/Icons/ArcanePower/Thermal/ArcanePower_Thermal_PipeRotorHead.dds</Icon>
      <Description>Sealed Arcane duplex pipe rotary union.
Native advanced rotor: its matching pipe head creates a real subgrid.
Connect H/C underneath the base and above the head.
Rotor displacement adjusts the casing gap from 10 to 30 cm (20 cm at zero).
Weld both parts fully; detaching either side breaks the thermal circuit.
The stationary 1x1x1 casing seals the hull even without a head.
Oxygen rooms do not connect across grids. Keep the head sweep clear.
For automatic radiator tracking without a subgrid, use the radiator rotor base.</Description>
