    <Definition xsi:type="MyObjectBuilder_UpgradeModuleDefinition">
      <Id>
        <TypeId>UpgradeModule</TypeId>
        <SubtypeId>ArcanePower_Thermal_HullRadiator</SubtypeId>
      </Id>
      <DisplayName>Arcane Hull radiator</DisplayName>
      <Icon>Textures/GUI/Icons/ArcanePower/Thermal/ArcanePower_Thermal_HullRadiator.dds</Icon>
      <Description>1 GW ideal heat rejection.
Fixed 1 deep x 2 high x 3 wide airtight hull backing.
Recessed front graphite face; keep it exposed to space.
Daisy-chain matching radiator edges on all four sides.
Normal H/C pipes connect at the lower rear socket.
Hull sockets self-seal when a connected radiator is removed.
Failed radiators keep the pipe seal but lose cooling. Keep reactor circuits separate.
Single exposed face: half the two-sided panel rating. No sun tracking.
Shade: 100% cooling; front in full sun: 50%.</Description>
