      <DisplayName>Arcane Atmospheric cooler upgraded</DisplayName>
      <Icon>Textures/GUI/Icons/ArcanePower/Thermal/ArcanePower_Thermal_AtmosphericCoolerUpgraded.dds</Icon>
      <Description>50 GW ideal heat rejection per unit/panel.

INSTALLATION
Airtight hull casing, rear manifold.
Keep 2.5 m clear beyond both exhaust fans.
Requires reactor auxiliary power for active cooling.

ENVIRONMENT
Zero cooling in vacuum; full rating at 1 atmosphere.
Half-clear exhaust gives 25% cooling; blocked gives none.

CRAFTING
Requires 10 Aether Residuum recovered from T1 fuel.</Description>
